<text format-version="0.2" work-id="w-weishu-weishou" book-id="b-weishu-weishou-013" chapter-id="c-weishu-weishou-013-mingyuanyao-marriage" source-id="s-weishu-weishou-013-mingyuanyao-marriage-ws2100436">
  <p id="c-weishu-weishou-013-mingyuanyao-marriage:p001" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="received_chapter">明元昭哀皇后<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-013-mingyuanyao-marriage:p001:m0006" ref="4b2_772_4b3">姚氏</persName>，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-013-mingyuanyao-marriage:p001:m0009" ref="b58_fbc_4e6">姚興</persName>女也，<persName id="c-weishu-weishou-013-mingyuanyao-marriage:p001:m0014" ref="b58_fbc_4e6">興</persName>封西平長公主。太宗以后禮納之，後為夫人。</p>
